    "body": "## Motivation\r\n\r\nLet the AMD CI runner route the container's Hugging Face downloads through an optional caching proxy.\r\n\r\n## Modifications\r\n\r\nIn `amd_ci_start_container.sh` and `amd_ci_start_container_disagg.sh`:\r\n\r\n- If the runner sets `HF_ENDPOINT` and `$HF_ENDPOINT/healthz` answers, pass `HF_ENDPOINT` (and `HF_HUB_DISABLE_XET` if set) into the container.\r\n- If the proxy doesn't answer, warn and download from huggingface.co as before.\r\n- If `HF_ENDPOINT` isn't set, nothing changes.\r\n\r\n## Tests\r\n\r\nRan the new block under `set -euo pipefail` with `HF_ENDPOINT` unset, proxy up, and proxy down. `bash -n` and shellcheck are clean.\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\r\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #41529194435](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41529194435)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41529194359](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41529194359)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #41529194405](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41529194405)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Base CI only covers the core cases, and its workload may not exercise your change. Use `/rerun-test` to run the tests your change touches, or copy this prompt for an agent:\n>\n> ```text\n> Find the registered tests this PR affects and run them with /rerun-test, following https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.agents/skills/rerun-test/SKILL.md\n> ```\n<!-- pr-states:end -->\r\n\r\n",
